## Color System — CRITICAL

**Never hardcode any hex color value anywhere in the codebase.** Every color must reference `AppColors`. This is enforced strictly.

```dart
// ❌ WRONG — never do this
color: Color(0xFF1F7D8C)
color: Colors.teal

// ✅ CORRECT — always do this
color: AppColors.accent
```

