## Design Language

### Card-Over-Hero Pattern
All auth screens and onboarding screens use this pattern:
- Full-bleed hero image or `AppColors.accentSoft` Container at top ~35% of screen
- White card slides up over hero with `borderRadius` topLeft and topRight `28px`
- Card has no bottom radius
- All form content inside card with `24px` horizontal padding

### Typography Scale
- Screen titles: bold 24–28px `AppColors.textPrimary` left-aligned
- Subtitles: 14px `AppColors.textSecondary` 4px below title
- Section labels: 13px `AppColors.textSecondary` bold 8px above fields
- Body text: 14px `AppColors.textPrimary`
- Secondary body: 13px `AppColors.textSecondary`
- Captions and badges: 10–12px

### Buttons
- **Primary (ink):** `AppColors.ink` background `AppColors.onInk` text full-width 52px height 14px radius bold 15px
- **Outline:** `AppColors.surface` background `AppColors.fieldBorder` border `AppColors.textPrimary` text same size
- **Destructive:** `AppColors.destructive` border `AppColors.destructive` text
- **Disabled:** `AppColors.indicatorInactive` background `AppColors.hint` text
- **Text button links:** `AppColors.primary` color no underline 14px

### Input Fields
- Background: `AppColors.fieldFill`
- Border: `AppColors.fieldBorder` 1px, radius 12px
- Height: 52px, padding horizontal 16px
- Focused border: `AppColors.accent` 1.5px
- Placeholder: `AppColors.hint`
- Labels: 13px `AppColors.textSecondary` 8px above field

### Cards in Lists
- Background: `AppColors.surface`
- Border: `AppColors.fieldBorder` 0.5px
- Radius: 16px
- Padding: 14px
- No shadows — elevation 0

### Bottom Navigation
- Background: `AppColors.surface`
- Top border: `AppColors.fieldBorder` 0.5px
- Active tab: `AppColors.ink` icon and label
- Inactive tab: `AppColors.textSecondary` icon and label
- Badge color: `AppColors.unread`

