## Tenant Onboarding Flow (4 Steps — Cannot Be Skipped)

```
Step 1 — Hard constraints
  Max budget (PHP), Gender policy, WiFi required,
  Private bathroom, Curfew needed
  → Stored in tenantProfiles collection

Step 2 — POI setup
  Google Maps pin placement
  POI type: School / Workplace / Other
  Search bar for location lookup
  → Stores poiLatitude, poiLongitude, poiAddress

Step 3 — Distance preference
  Slider 0–10 km
  Live preview: "Properties within X km of [POI] will appear"
  → Stores locationRadiusKm
  Note: Step 2 MUST come before Step 3 because
  Step 3 references the POI address from Step 2

Step 4 — TOPSIS weights
  Three sliders: Monthly rent, Distance from POI, Amenities
  Defaults: 35% / 35% / 30%
  Live total counter — green checkmark at exactly 100%
  Find My Matches button disabled until total = 100%
  → Stores weightRent, weightDistance, weightAmenities
```

---

## Owner Onboarding Flow (After Admin Approval Only)

```
Document upload → Verification pending → Admin approves → 
Add property → Property rules → Pricing and amenities → 
Owner TOPSIS weights → Owner main app
```

Owner cannot access property listing, Find Tenants, or Inquiries features until `isVerified = true` in Firestore.

