## Mock Data Location

All static test data lives in `lib/core/constants/mock_data.dart`. This is the single source of truth for all hardcoded development data. Use realistic Filipino context:
- Names: Maria Santos, Juan dela Cruz, Ana Reyes
- Locations: Matina, Ecoland, Buhangin, Toril — all Davao City
- Schools: USEP, ADDU, UM, USeP-Tagum
- Amounts: ₱3,000 to ₱6,000 monthly rent range

